          "en": "and therefore you should hash them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 12.21,
          "en": "And for that attached you find a hash.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
